# 🍃 mongo-tool

List, back up, and restore any MongoDB — containerised, host-installed, or remote.

The script talks to MongoDB over TCP using ordinary connection details (host, port,
user, password). It does **not** shell into Docker, so the same copy works against a
container, a locally installed `mongod`, or a database on another server.

